# --- Visual Studio / MSBuild ---
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.idb
*.tlog
